graph TD
    A[CustomButton Widget] --> B[ElevatedButton]
    B --> C[ButtonStyle Config]
    C --> C1[backgroundColor ?? AppColors.primary]
    C --> C2[minimumSize: minWidth ?? infinity, minHeight ?? 48]
    C --> C3[disabledBackgroundColor & disabledForegroundColor]

    B --> D{_buildButtonContent Helper Method}
    D -- isLoading == true --> E[SizedBox 22x22 -> CircularProgressIndicator White]
    D -- isLoading == false --> F[Text buttonLabel with AppStyles]
